OL,3,GNEWSAUK-EU deal could see NI suppliers
OL,4,Aimport products 'without all the red
OL,5,Atape'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK and EU's draft deal on food and
OL,8,Fplant products could allow suppliers in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland to import products
OL,10,F"without all the red tape".
OL,12,FIf passed, the deal could benefit
OL,13,Fexporters based in Great Britain as it
OL,14,Fwould reduce the extra costs and
OL,15,Fpaperwork they face when selling goods
OL,16,Fto EU states and Northern Ireland.
OL,18,FIt should also remove many of the
OL,19,Fpost-Brexit goods checks between GB and
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
