OL,6,
OL,7,FRobin Mercer, who runs the Hillmount
OL,8,Fchain of garden centre stores in
OL,9,Fcounties Antrim and Down, said:
OL,10,F"Honestly, all gardeners and plant
OL,11,Fsuppliers are going to be so happy
OL,12,Fthat, if we can get rid of all this red
OL,13,Ftape, it will be amazing.
